WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.734 --> 00:00:03.067
-New text messages reveal

00:00:03.067 --> 00:00:04.868
that even more
high-ranking Republicans

00:00:04.868 --> 00:00:06.267
than we initially knew
were involved

00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:08.334
in Donald Trump's attempt
to overturn the election,

00:00:08.334 --> 00:00:10.167
including his son, Don Jr.

00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:12.367
Also, Trump is still ranting
about windmills

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:16.701
and conservatives are talking
about tanning their testicles.

00:00:16.701 --> 00:00:19.033
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:22.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:26.033
With all of the major crises
we currently face --

00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:28.534
war in Ukraine,
COVID cases rising again,

00:00:28.534 --> 00:00:31.167
impending climate disaster,
and a widening wealth gap

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:35.067
with power concentrated in fewer
and fewer corporate hands --

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:37.300
you'd think Republicans
would have moved on

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:38.934
from their usual
weird obsessions.

00:00:38.934 --> 00:00:41.601
But last week, Donald Trump
did an interview on Fox News,

00:00:41.601 --> 00:00:44.334
and you'll never guess
what he wanted to talk about.

00:00:44.334 --> 00:00:48.234
-Today I saw a big story
that there are very -- millions

00:00:48.234 --> 00:00:51.934
and millions of dollars
are being charged on windmills

00:00:51.934 --> 00:00:53.801
because they're killing eagles.

00:00:53.801 --> 00:00:55.767
They're killing the bald eagle

00:00:55.767 --> 00:00:58.334
and other eagles
and other birds.

00:00:58.334 --> 00:01:00.400
And we have these windmills
all over the place,

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.968
and the environmentalists
pretend they love them,

00:01:02.968 --> 00:01:04.734
but they're really
hurting our country.

00:01:04.734 --> 00:01:06.234
-It's funny how certain
people want me

00:01:06.234 --> 00:01:07.634
to stop talking
about Donald Trump,

00:01:07.634 --> 00:01:10.400
but Donald Trump won't stop
talking about windmills.

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:12.567
And in my defense,
Donald Trump was president,

00:01:12.567 --> 00:01:15.200
and windmills are just
[bleep] windmills.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:17.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:19.033
It's also very unconvincing
that he cares

00:01:19.033 --> 00:01:20.567
for the well-being of bird life,

00:01:20.567 --> 00:01:22.434
especially when he pronounces
"eagle" like that.

00:01:22.434 --> 00:01:23.968
with the emphasis
on the first letter,

00:01:23.968 --> 00:01:25.634
Does he think it's like email?

00:01:25.634 --> 00:01:27.734
[As Trump] Sean, the other day
I saw an eagle

00:01:27.734 --> 00:01:29.234
logging into his email,

00:01:29.234 --> 00:01:30.934
smoking an e-cigarette,
and I'll tell you

00:01:30.934 --> 00:01:32.801
it's destroying our country.

00:01:32.801 --> 00:01:34.300
[Normal voice]
Now, of course, it is unfair

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:36.067
to just play a clip of Trump
from an interview

00:01:36.067 --> 00:01:38.033
without also playing
the question that prompted it.

00:01:38.033 --> 00:01:40.868
I'm sure his "windmills are
Freddy Krueger, but for birds"

00:01:40.868 --> 00:01:42.734
answer makes more sense
in context.

00:01:42.734 --> 00:01:44.100
Let's give it a listen.

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:46.501
-Most economists now say
this is going to turn

00:01:46.501 --> 00:01:49.667
into a full-blown recession,
and maybe worse.

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:52.801
What do you see
if he doesn't change course?

00:01:52.801 --> 00:01:55.100
-So, of course, it had nothing
to do with windmills.

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:56.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:57.467
What was I expecting?

00:01:57.467 --> 00:01:59.767
What possible question
could've justified that answer?

00:01:59.767 --> 00:02:01.234
"Sir, I'd like to get
your thoughts

00:02:01.234 --> 00:02:03.167
on our treasured
avian population

00:02:03.167 --> 00:02:05.000
and various threats
to their survival,

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:08.133
including new forms of energy
dependent on wind.

00:02:08.133 --> 00:02:10.334
If possible, start with
a big story you saw today,

00:02:10.334 --> 00:02:11.501
and should you mention eagles,

00:02:11.501 --> 00:02:13.334
do feel free
to pronounce it weird."

00:02:13.334 --> 00:02:17.234
-Today I saw a big story
that there are very -- millions

00:02:17.234 --> 00:02:20.934
and millions of dollars
are being charged on windmills

00:02:20.934 --> 00:02:23.200
because they're killing eagles.

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:26.934
-And you want Trump to comment
on Biden changing course?

00:02:26.934 --> 00:02:28.968
Trump has never changed
course in his life.

00:02:28.968 --> 00:02:30.667
That's why he's obsessed
with windmills.

00:02:30.667 --> 00:02:33.334
He just goes around in circles
and makes a giant sucking sound.

00:02:33.334 --> 00:02:35.300
But say what you will
about the guy --

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:37.734
he's always laser-focused
on his grudges,

00:02:37.734 --> 00:02:40.367
whether it's windmills or
the Democrats investigating him.

00:02:40.367 --> 00:02:43.133
Yesterday, Trump,
devout Christian that he is,

00:02:43.133 --> 00:02:46.100
issued an Easter message
that said in part,

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:50.267
"Happy Easter to all, including
the Radical Left Maniacs

00:02:50.267 --> 00:02:52.601
who are doing everything
possible to destroy our Country.

00:02:52.601 --> 00:02:55.801
May they not succeed,
but let them, nevertheless,

00:02:55.801 --> 00:02:58.434
be happy, healthy,
wealthy, and well!"

00:02:58.434 --> 00:02:59.601
Now, in fairness --

00:02:59.601 --> 00:03:02.067
in fairness,
he is quoting the Bible there.

00:03:02.067 --> 00:03:05.234
Who can forget when Jesus said
unto his disciples,

00:03:05.234 --> 00:03:08.133
"Blessed are the meek, for they
shall inherit the earth,

00:03:08.133 --> 00:03:10.133
except of course,
for the meek birds

00:03:10.133 --> 00:03:12.534
whose heads I'm takin' off
with a windmill blade"?

00:03:12.534 --> 00:03:13.701
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.701 --> 00:03:15.133
Also, just a side note here,

00:03:15.133 --> 00:03:16.968
but Radical Left Maniacs
is a great band name.

00:03:16.968 --> 00:03:20.300
I'm pretty sure I saw them
at the Warped Tour in 1995.

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:23.200
They were kind of like
the Mighty Mighty Bosstones,

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:26.334
or at least that's
the impression that I got.

00:03:26.334 --> 00:03:27.567
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:27.567 --> 00:03:30.267
And that was today's
Joke for Ska Fans.

00:03:30.267 --> 00:03:31.767
[ Laughter ]

00:03:31.767 --> 00:03:33.667
We just have to -- I'm just
saying, when we do it,

00:03:33.667 --> 00:03:36.334
like, just let's try to invite
ska fans that day.

00:03:36.334 --> 00:03:38.434
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.434 --> 00:03:39.934
You know what I mean?
Like let's send --

00:03:39.934 --> 00:03:41.234
when the email goes out
for tickets,

00:03:41.234 --> 00:03:42.567
if it's going to be
ska joke day,

00:03:42.567 --> 00:03:45.067
like, let's just try
to pack the house a little.

00:03:45.067 --> 00:03:46.400
[ Laughter ]

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:49.234
'Cause I'm out here [bleep]
you know, risking it.

00:03:49.234 --> 00:03:51.801
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.801 --> 00:03:54.300
And I'm getting nothing back.

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:56.133
And look,
I look forward to ska day

00:03:56.133 --> 00:03:58.167
as much as anybody!

00:03:58.167 --> 00:03:59.667
But if we're not going to do

00:03:59.667 --> 00:04:02.901
any, like, audience maintenance
on ska day...

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:08.000
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:12.033
And yet, still, none of that was
the pettiest or weirdest thing

00:04:12.033 --> 00:04:14.267
to happen in right-wing politics
this week,

00:04:14.267 --> 00:04:18.067
