Fox News host Tucker Carlson

00:04:18.067 --> 00:04:20.901
previewed a new episode
for Fox's streaming service,

00:04:20.901 --> 00:04:23.567
where he expressed concern
that, among other things,

00:04:23.567 --> 00:04:26.534
