were declining, and interviewed

00:04:26.534 --> 00:04:29.200
a guest who proposed
an interesting solution.

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:32.367
-If you want to optimize
and take it to another level,

00:04:32.367 --> 00:04:34.234
expose yourself
to red light therapy.

00:04:34.234 --> 00:04:35.767
-Yes.
-And the Joovv

00:04:35.767 --> 00:04:38.300
that we were using
in the documentary,

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:40.567
there's a massive amount of --
-Which is testicle tanning.

00:04:40.567 --> 00:04:41.834
-It's testicle tanning,

00:04:41.834 --> 00:04:45.267
but it's also full-body
red light therapy,

00:04:45.267 --> 00:04:46.901
which has massive
amount of benefits.

00:04:46.901 --> 00:04:49.701
And there's so much data
out there

00:04:49.701 --> 00:04:51.167
