or covered.

00:04:51.167 --> 00:04:54.000
-So, obviously, half the viewers
right now are like, "What?

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:56.868
That's -- testicle tanning?
That's crazy!"

00:04:56.868 --> 00:04:59.901
But my view is, okay,
testosterone levels crash

00:04:59.901 --> 00:05:03.334
and nobody says anything
about it -- that's crazy.

00:05:03.334 --> 00:05:05.934
So, why is it crazy
to seek solutions?

00:05:05.934 --> 00:05:07.133
-It's not!

00:05:07.133 --> 00:05:08.901
Clearly, Donald Trump
has already tried it.

00:05:08.901 --> 00:05:10.534
I also...

00:05:10.534 --> 00:05:12.033
[ Laughter ]

00:05:12.033 --> 00:05:13.868
I also like that Tucker says

00:05:13.868 --> 00:05:16.767
half of his viewers will think
testicle tanning is crazy.

00:05:16.767 --> 00:05:19.367
I'm going to go out on a limb
and say that if you're tuning in

00:05:19.367 --> 00:05:21.100
to watch
a Tucker Carlson special

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:24.100
