and the other half

00:05:31.501 --> 00:05:33.534
was saying, "Testicle tanning?
Tell me something I don't know.

00:05:33.534 --> 00:05:35.567
I suppose my nuts
to red light therapy every day.

00:05:35.567 --> 00:05:37.834
Sometimes I just drop 'em
straight into the toaster

00:05:37.834 --> 00:05:39.467
