entire junk in the microwave

00:05:43.601 --> 00:05:45.100
and put it on popcorn mode.

00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:49.267
That's just
when you're advanced."

00:05:49.267 --> 00:05:53.100
It's so insane, even Kid Rock,

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:55.734
who for some reason
was a guest on this special

00:05:55.734 --> 00:05:57.167
or whatever it was,

00:05:57.167 --> 00:05:58.534
