his head around it.

00:05:58.534 --> 00:06:01.100
-Dude, stop.
Testicle tanning? Come on.

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:02.100
[ Laughs ]

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:03.300
I mean...
-Yeah, yeah.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:04.834
-I haven't heard anything
that good in a long time.

00:06:04.834 --> 00:06:06.501
-Open your mind, Bobby!

00:06:06.501 --> 00:06:09.801
Don't you think at this point,
