a romantic evening

00:07:21.968 --> 00:07:23.300
outside in the moonlight,

00:07:23.300 --> 00:07:24.734
and then when they
least expect it --

00:07:24.734 --> 00:07:27.868
whoom! -- windmill chop,
off with their head!"

00:07:27.868 --> 00:07:29.601
The point is,

00:07:29.601 --> 00:07:31.567
these are the people leading
the conservative movement

00:07:31.567 --> 00:07:33.133
in the Republican Party
at a time

00:07:33.133 --> 00:07:35.834
when it is poised to retake
power in the November midterms

00:07:35.834 --> 00:07:38.534
and possibly renominate Trump
for president in 2024,

00:07:38.534 --> 00:07:41.200
even as we continue to learn
more about his efforts

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:42.534
to overturn the last election.

00:07:42.534 --> 00:07:44.934
For example,
newly unearthed text messages

00:07:44.934 --> 00:07:48.534
reveal that yet another sitting
senator, Utah's Mike Lee,

00:07:48.534 --> 00:07:50.501
