with the White House on ways

00:07:50.501 --> 00:07:53.200
to overturn the results,
including pitching a plan

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.934
to appoint alternate slate
of electors from swing states.

00:07:55.934 --> 00:07:57.434
At one point in November 2020,

00:07:57.434 --> 00:07:59.434
he texted Trump's
chief of staff, Mark Meadows...

00:08:03.968 --> 00:08:05.767
And then, two days later,
said again...

00:08:08.033 --> 00:08:10.033
I'm not sure it's a good idea
to go to Trump

00:08:10.033 --> 00:08:12.267
