what you should be saying.

00:08:12.267 --> 00:08:14.767
Trump would make a terrible
Cyrano de Bergerac.

00:08:14.767 --> 00:08:16.434
"Cyrano, tell me
what to say to her!"

00:08:16.434 --> 00:08:18.501
[As Trump] Tell her she's got
a butt that won't quit

00:08:18.501 --> 00:08:20.167
