00:08:20.167 --> 00:08:21.501
[ Laughter ]

00:08:21.501 --> 00:08:23.234
[Normal voice] And Lee wasn't
the only one in on it.

00:08:23.234 --> 00:08:24.934
There are also new
secret text messages

00:08:24.934 --> 00:08:26.634
from Trump's son Don Jr.

00:08:26.634 --> 00:08:28.534
-November 5, 2022 --

00:08:28.534 --> 00:08:31.167
two days after
the 2020 election.

00:08:31.167 --> 00:08:33.100
Votes were still being counted,

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:35.167
