several options.

00:08:47.367 --> 00:08:50.801
"We have operational control.
Total leverage."

00:08:50.801 --> 00:08:53.968
Trump Jr was texting White House
Chief of Staff Mark Meadows.

00:08:53.968 --> 00:08:56.534
-I love when dummies
like Don Jr. use phrases

00:08:56.534 --> 00:08:59.033
like "total leverage"
and "operational control."

00:08:59.033 --> 00:09:02.534
He sounds like the bad guy
