00:09:06.267 --> 00:09:07.901
"We have operational control.

00:09:07.901 --> 00:09:09.901
Hold on, someone's tapping me
on the shoulder.

00:09:09.901 --> 00:09:12.534
Let me just turn around and --
Oh, no! Jean-Claude!"

00:09:12.534 --> 00:09:13.868
[ Laughter ]

00:09:13.868 --> 00:09:15.634
And he had to text
the chief of staff

00:09:15.634 --> 00:09:17.567
