going straight to his own dad.

00:09:17.567 --> 00:09:20.067
"We are in
operational control.

00:09:20.067 --> 00:09:22.100
Now, do you have
my father's email address?

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:23.601
I would like to set up
a father-son

00:09:23.601 --> 00:09:26.434
