00:09:26.434 --> 00:09:28.434
This is the state of the modern
conservative movement

00:09:28.434 --> 00:09:31.300
as they aim to retake power.
They're focused on windmills,

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.634
testosterone levels,
overturning elections.

00:09:33.634 --> 00:09:34.968
Just a word of advice --

00:09:34.968 --> 00:09:38.000
I'd be careful not to do
